sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Caller
  participant R as Ravel CLI
  participant W as Rhai worker
  participant F as Token file
  participant M as Claude Code, confined
  C->>R: start-session --confine
  R->>R: Check each tokenHandoffs record in the settings
  R->>R: Prepare confinement and refuse a grant over a token file
  R->>W: Evaluate the request
  W-->>R: Selection that names claude-code
  R->>F: Check expires, file type, owner, mode and size
  alt A check fails
    R-->>C: token_handoff_unavailable, exit 3, nothing launched
  else Every check passes
    F-->>R: Token bytes, read once
    R->>R: Socket pair: write, shut down and close Ravel's end
    R->>M: Launch with the other end and the declared variable
    M->>M: Read to end of stream and remove the variable
  end
